<%- include('partials/header', {title:'Portfolio'}) %>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">OUR WORK</div><h1>Selected <span>Projects.</span></h1><p>A look at some of the work we have delivered.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-pad"><div class="container"><div class="row g-4">
<% if (!projects.length) { %><div class="col-12"><div class="empty-state"><i class="bi bi-images"></i><h4>Our portfolio is growing.</h4><p class="text-secondary">Completed projects will appear here. Check back soon.</p></div></div><% } %>
<% projects.forEach(project => { %><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"><div class="project-card h-100"><% if (project.image) { %><img src="<%= project.image %>" alt="<%= project.title %>"><% } else { %><div class="project-placeholder"><i class="bi bi-window"></i></div><% } %><div class="p-4"><small class="text-orange"><%= project.category %></small><h5 class="mt-2"><%= project.title %></h5><p class="text-secondary"><%= project.description || '' %></p><% if (project.project_url) { %><a class="text-link" href="<%= project.project_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View project <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a><% } %></div></div></div><% }) %>
</div></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
